  <item>
    <title>06 复盘六月两场世预赛，展望未来</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68b721a25faf368659b9494c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68b721a25faf368659b9494c</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 02 Sep 2025 17:30:32 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期录制于2025年6月14日，几位阿迷开会，深入复盘了阿根廷国家队六月两场喜忧参半的世预赛，讨论了核心球员的状态与角色，也展望了26年世界杯的阵容。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="138">02:18</a> 智利 0-1 阿根廷：复盘与交流</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="477">07:57</a> 劳塔罗的定位</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="813">13:33</a> 梅西的现状</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="916">15:16</a> 新人观察：尼科-帕斯、阿尔马达</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1512">25:12</a> 阿根廷 1-1 哥伦比亚：复盘与交流</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1538">25:38</a> 联想类比之前负于巴拉圭、乌拉圭的比赛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1740">29:00</a> 对哥伦比亚迪亚斯的看法，右侧和后腰防守的问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2204">36:44</a> 再论阿尔马达</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2890">48:10</a> 畅所欲言！开会和夸夸</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3558">59:18</a> 阿尔瓦雷斯、德保罗及一些其他球员</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5121">1:25:21</a> 排兵布阵：26年世界杯阵容预想</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6318">1:45:18</a> 阿迷托佛！夹带私货的许愿环节 :)</span></p><span></span><p><span>卡司：蓝白不朽、PampasM10M14、牢摩bnb、TheWorldForWorldIsForest</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>参考资料：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>阵型图感谢 PampasM10M14 提供</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ftxw8ngpEXB-FO_TUpKzOoJFJdLr.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ftq5gy1G-M0u5lt7ZXoEkrxsgLh-.jpeg"></figure>]]></description>
