  <item>
    <title>05【美洲杯】在休斯顿现场看阿根廷vs厄瓜多尔是怎样一种体验</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/668d8409ae8e21859ab5d19f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">668d8409ae8e21859ab5d19f</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 09 Jul 2024 18:40:09 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在休斯顿现场观看2024美洲杯阿根廷 vs 厄瓜多尔的淘汰赛是怎样一种体验？本期播客是我们第一时间录制的观赛 Reaction：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="32">00:32</a> 超级无敌紧张的点球大战，还好我们有大马丁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="177">02:57</a> 连巴西大妈都不敢看点球大战</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="274">04:34</a> 利马进球，他值得！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="359">05:59</a> 厄瓜多尔没进的点球（还好没进）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="410">06:50</a> 在青旅碰到的阿根廷球迷对本场比赛的评价</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="432">07:12</a> 评价恩佐、冈皇、莫利纳</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="470">07:50</a> 吐槽裁判</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="505">08:25</a> 一位利马人迷和一位罗梅罗人迷开始进行粉丝向 Reaction</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="659">10:59</a> 守护世界上最好的98line</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="813">13:33</a> 阿迷托佛！夹带私货的许愿环节 :)</span></p><span></span><p><span>卡司：Annie、蒙锥克山的蘑菇、Jason</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：Annie</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lsn1gCOIUANyL-Ktx4tI1834VqrL.m4a" length="14332932" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:14:44</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuqqgXbMG5snpifGcMFE866vg62A.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>04【美洲杯】在迈阿密现场看阿根廷vs秘鲁是怎样一种体验</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/668c523d8fcadceb90eeca5b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">668c523d8fcadceb90eeca5b</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 08 Jul 2024 20:55:25 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在迈阿密现场观看2024美洲杯阿根廷 vs 秘鲁的比赛是怎样一种体验？本期播客是我们第一时间录制的观赛 Reaction：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="29">00:29</a> 回顾新泽西观赛体验：阿根廷 vs 智利</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="110">01:50</a> 回顾新泽西观赛体验：松弛的乌拉圭球迷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="246">04:06</a> 入场之前：在硬石球场等球员大巴、看阿根廷人烤肉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="276">04:36</a> 回程 Reaction 开始</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="357">05:57</a> 吐槽阿根廷比赛的票价</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="407">06:47</a> 打卡梅西和阿根廷队去过的餐厅 Baires Grill，打卡梅西最爱吃的 Milanesa Napolitana</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="460">07:40</a> 硬石球场是一个好球场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="573">09:33</a> 阿根廷球迷印象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="689">11:29</a> 努力的秘鲁球迷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="769">12:49</a> 首发阵容：替补二阵以及被关小黑屋的斯卡洛尼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a> 上半场观后感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1033">17:13</a> 好消息：塔罗进球了 坏消息：都没拍到</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1075">17:55</a> ……但是拍到了塔队被吹掉的进球，和帕雷德斯没进的点球</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1219">20:19</a> 美洲杯的劳塔罗才是大号登录的塔罗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1297">21:37</a> 现场注意到的一些失误</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1390">23:10</a> 小组第一出线</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1540">25:40</a> 阿迷托佛！夹带私货的许愿环节 :)</span></p><span></span><p><span>卡司：Annie、Madeleine、灰灰、北京小梅西、Glacier</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：Annie</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lqCGz5bSbZ0T_allt7I0I_WVaQa2.m4a" length="52361731" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:27:07</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuqqgXbMG5snpifGcMFE866vg62A.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
