  <item>
    <title>02 夏天的前奏：三月国家队+U23友谊赛回顾</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6643022282b428eafd740b17</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6643022282b428eafd740b17</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 14 May 2024 06:18:10 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>第二期节目录制于三月底阿根廷国家队和U23友谊赛之后，我们分别盘点了这四场比赛，并对夏天的美洲杯和奥运会大胆猜测、小心展望。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:30</a> 阿根廷 3-0 萨尔瓦多</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="101">01:41</a> 左路年轻人：加纳乔、巴尔科</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="868">14:28</a> 阿根廷 3-1 哥斯达黎加</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="885">14:45</a> 奥迪的隐患，中卫接班人盘点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1807">30:07</a> 鼓掌！劳塔罗终于破进球荒了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2175">36:15</a> 拷打！倒霉冈皇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2359">39:19</a> 眼前一亮！小卡尔博尼国家队首秀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2510">41:50</a> 啃老！迪马利亚，永远的天使</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2705">45:05</a> 美洲杯大名单猜测</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3135">52:15</a> 阿根廷U23 4-2 墨西哥U23</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3161">52:41</a> 苏莱神仙球</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3225">53:45</a> U23名单讨论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3728">1:02:08</a> 阿根廷U23 0-3 墨西哥U23</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4102">1:08:22</a> 新星：博卡18岁中卫安塞尔米诺</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4627">1:17:07</a> 新一届阿根廷U17参加蒙太古杯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4845">1:20:45</a> 美洲杯全部参赛球队确定，揭幕战阿根廷 vs 加拿大</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5290">1:28:10</a> 阿迷托佛！夹带私货的许愿环节 :)</span></p><span></span><p><span>卡司：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Annie（微博 @anulomufa）</span></p><span></span><p><span>何淇（微博 @蓝白不朽）</span></p><span></span><p><span>培根（微博 @不是峰是锋）</span></p><span></span><p><span>小龙虾（微博 @想吃小龙虾嗷）</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：星期六（微博 @Saturday_星期六）</span></p>]]></description>
