  <item>
    <title>01 力克巴西，剑指巴黎：阿根廷U23奥预赛回顾</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65fdeb902d9eae5d0a7994b9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65fdeb902d9eae5d0a7994b9</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 22 Mar 2024 20:35:28 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>第一期节目录制于一个月前奥预赛结束的那一周，我们回顾了阿根廷U23的南美奥预赛之旅，展望了 2024 巴黎奥运会的阵容，分享了值得关注的球员资讯。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:30</a> 赛程回顾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="106">01:46</a> 首战巴拉圭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="251">04:11</a> 终战巴西点评</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="597">09:57</a> 球员盘点-门将：布雷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="701">11:41</a> 球员盘点-中卫：（马拉蒂尼）、瓦伦蒂尼、迪塞萨雷、奎罗斯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1066">17:46</a> 球员盘点-边卫：巴尔科、纳尔多尼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1658">27:38</a> 球员盘点-中场：小雷东多、斯福扎、埃基-费尔南德斯、梅迪纳</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1920">32:00</a> 球员盘点-中场：阿尔马达、罗德里格斯、埃切维里</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2457">40:57</a> 球员盘点-锋线：贡杜、卡斯特罗、索拉里、冈萨雷斯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3021">50:21</a> 奥运会阵容畅想</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3460">57:40</a> 球员资讯总结：进击的U17，进击的中卫，请客吃饭的好前辈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4045">1:07:25</a> 阿迷托佛！夹带私货的许愿环节 :)</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>参考资料：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>2024奥运会适龄球员汇总 by Sudanalytics</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fpo4sNyH8Hk1VhxSG4S4hWbMbb1M.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>2006-07级世少赛球员追踪 by @anulomufa</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlRicb8pnZTwY5CjY-Vo8QSCKIsc.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>卡司：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>Annie（微博 @anulomufa）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Nick（微博 @EstelaJayfeather）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>小龙虾（微博 @想吃小龙虾嗷）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>剪辑：Annie</span></p>]]></description>
